	quest.5A788FC5B2504748.quest_desc: [
		"§eHow to make a tool:§r craft a blueprint (for example, a Pickaxe Blueprint). Put the blueprint and materials in a crafting grid to make the head. Then combine head + rod (+ binding, grip or tip if you like) to make the tool."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Pickaxe Blueprint and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
