	quest.75052CF638FBC672.title: "Alloy Forge"
	quest.7928E8F4133A05DB.quest_desc: [
		"Silent Gear builds tools and armor from parts. Every material has its own stats, and mixing materials in one part blends them."
		""
		"§eThe path:§r collect flax for bindings, make blueprints, craft tool heads from any metal or gem, then assemble the tool. Later, grade materials, forge alloys and charge them with starlight. Start by farming some flax string."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 8 x Flax String and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
